<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS cuts Stratec EPS outlook.</title>
<headline>UBS cuts Stratec EPS outlook.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS said it had reduced its earnings per share estimate for medical technology group Stratec but reiterated its &quot;hold&quot; recommendation for the shares.</p>
<p>It gave these earnings estimates after Stratec reported 23 percent sales growth in the first half but said operating margins would slip in the second half.</p>
<p>	Net profit (million Sfr)  EPS (Sfr)	  Dividend (Sfr)</p>
<p> 1997	 43		    66			 24</p>
<p> 1998	 50		    77			 27</p>
<p> 1999	 58		    92			 32</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
